      "review_description": "I found the installer via OzBargain and had a great experience from start to finish. Rob was extremely responsive to all my queries and was happy to make changes to the system as per my requests, without any issues. From quote to installation, everything moved along fairly quickly.The installers were punctual, friendly, and highly communicative throughout the process. They went above and beyond by replacing a large number of broken tiles on the roof (sourced by me) from a previous installer.After the installation, they were quick to return to tidy up a few things, ensuring everything was in perfect order. The system has been generating exactly as per the specs outlined in the quote, and I’m really pleased with the results.Overall, I couldn’t be happier with the service and pricing of the solar system and install! Highly recommend.",
